1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,180
Savitri chose Satyavan as her husband,

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,780
even after learning that he was fated

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,400
to die within a year.

4
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:10,728
She married him without abandoning her choice.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,680
When the day arrived,

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:16,000
Satyavan collapsed while gathering wood in the

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,680
forest. Yama, lord of death,

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,602
came to claim his life.

9
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:24,780
Savitri followed Yama along the road away

10
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:25,560
from the living.

11
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,780
He told her to return,

12
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,780
but she answered with wisdom and would

13
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:31,577
not leave.

14
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:37,020
Impressed, Yama granted her boons except Satyavan’s

15
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:40,500
life. Savitri asked for blessings on her

16
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,827
family and for children of her own.

17
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:47,400
Her final request made the contradiction impossible:

18
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:50,200
how could she have children with Satyavan

19
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,400
if he remained dead?

20
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,824
Yama restored his life.

21
00:00:54,924 --> 00:00:57,440
She had not overpowered death with a

22
00:00:57,440 --> 00:01:00,080
weapon. She had followed it with resolve

23
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:03,000
and reason, and brought her husband home.
